 "fleshExperimentLines": [
  "Nomsa sets aside time with Drum-Belly flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. An hour passes. Calm stomach. Another hour. Nothing. \"It's food,\" Nomsa tells the fire. \"You know it in your gut. Literally.\" The Codex notes it.",
  "Mia sets aside time with Nightlight flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. An hour passes. Calm stomach. Another hour. Nothing. \"It's food,\" Mia tells the fire. \"You know it in your gut. Literally.\" The Codex notes it.",
  "Aria sets aside time with Big-Eyes flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. An hour passes. Calm stomach. Another hour. Nothing. \"It's food,\" Aria tells the fire. \"You know it in your gut. Literally.\" The Codex notes it.",
  "Aria sets aside time with The Ugly Beast flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. An hour passes. Calm stomach. Another hour. Nothing. \"It's food,\" Aria tells the fire. \"You know it in your gut. Literally.\" The Codex notes it.",
  "Raj sets aside time with Rut King flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. An hour passes. Calm stomach. Another hour. Nothing. \"It's food,\" Raj tells the fire. \"You know it in your gut. Literally.\" The Codex notes it."
 ],
